   "source": [
    "### Part A — Outlier Justification\n",
    "**What I did with the 50-hour study value:**\n",
    "I replaced the unrealistic 50-hour study value with the median of the `study_hours` column.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Justification:**\n",
    "1. **Unrealistic Value:** A study time of 50 hours is physically and logistically impossible in this context.\n",
    "2. **Preventing Skewed Math:** If left untouched, that single 50 would heavily distort our mean, standard deviation, and correlation results.\n",
    "3. **Preserving Data:** Instead of deleting the entire student row (which would waste their valid attendance and previous mark), replacing it with the median neutralizes the error while keeping the rest of the record safe."
   ]
  },
